## Shared implementation wording

A robustness check asserted in the paper without numbers or code is eligible
for the plan and cannot be rejected as a duplicate on that ground. Propose
it when it bears on the main result; the signer may reject it for another
explicit reason. Proposal does not authorize execution.

This is implementation wording faithful to the ruling, not a verbatim quote
from the author's conversation. The same wording belongs in probe and in the
receiver-owned future/reusable panel prompt; preserve frozen pilot prompts.

